{"id": "ebd65044-9494-4899-836e-989ff3d97beb", "role": "assistant", "block_type": "thinking", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Found the root cause: the EC2 interface endpoint (vpce-087378847f729d891) has PrivateDnsEnabled set to false, which explains the resolution failure. It's deployed in both private subnets matching the instance subnets, and I'm now checking the associated ENIs to confirm placement.

